BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Nataraja Yoga
UID:event_315178738@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260626T042502Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T203000
SUMMARY:Evening Pranayama & Yoga Nidra
DESCRIPTION:Nataraja School of Traditional Yoga\n**Evening Pranayama & Yog
 a Nidra**\n**Songbird Community Healing Center Cotati**\n**Friday June 26t
 h**\n**7pm**\nTake an inward journey beyond the mind\, intellect & senses 
 with seated calming\, balancing & subtle yogic breathing including pranava
  pranayama\, merging with the vibration of Om and internal sound current. 
 Then transitioning to savasana for yoga nidra - guided by verbal instructi
 ons that occupy the mind through rotation of consciousness\, visualization
 s\, breath awareness\, awareness of sensations and feelings and awareness 
 of subtle body elements. Experience expanded awareness in a state of deep 
 relaxation\, promoting parasympathetic dominance\, calming the physical bo
 dy\, mind\, brain\, senses\, and nervous system - that eventually leads us
  into a meditative state. As the body relaxes\, remaining aware as a witne
 ss\, we move into a subtle state of deep conscious sleep (the state betwee
 n wakefulness and sleep). With pratyahara (sense withdrawal)\, we work thr
 ough levels of the unconscious and subconscious\, removing energetic block
 ages which can be in the form of trauma\, stress\, health issues\, physica
 l and emotional disturbances. This experience is a powerful way to set our
  intention and plant it’s seeds with our Sankalpa (Resolve\, Resolution\
 , Force of Will) which is established during yoga nidra. When our mind is 
 calm and quiet during yoga nidra it is more receptive and sensitive to our
  intentions as they are impressed on the subconscious mind.\n\\*\\*$25 RSV
 P Required - Kara Weimer @ 707.235.1413\, [sunyogadance@gmail.com**](http:
 //sunyogadance@gmail.com%2A%2A/)\n[natarajaschooloftraditionalyoga.com](ht
 tp://natarajaschooloftraditionalyoga.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/nataraja-school-of-traditional-yoga/e
 vents/315178738/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260609T023820Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T023820Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Nataraja Yoga
UID:event_315199232@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260626T042502Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260630T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260630T100000
SUMMARY:Outdoor Pranayama
DESCRIPTION:Nataraja School of Traditional Yoga\n**Morning Pranayama - Tra
 ditional Yogic Breathwork with Kara Weimer**\n**Tuesdays 9-10am**\n\\*\\*R
 SVP ONLY - \\*Certain injuries & health issues may be contraindicated - Pl
 ease contact me if you have a concern \\*\\*\\*\n\nStart your morning with
  traditional yogic breathwork with the added benefits of sunshine\, fresh 
 air and grounding. It is ideal to practice pranayama outside.\n\nPranayama
  is distinct from modern breathwork. It is an important component & taught
  in context to the process of yoga. Designed to harness prana (life force 
 energy)\, purify & balance the nadis (channels) & awaken subtle energy for
  physical\, mental\, and spiritual development. Not limited to just well-b
 eing. Not a quick fix or forceful temporary cathartic experiences\, but ta
 ught as a safe & gradual process requiring discipline & consistency.\n\nRe
 lease toxins\, clear and align the energy channels\, strengthen the lungs\
 , massage\, tone & nourish internal organs\, strengthen agni & digestion\,
  oxygenate and improve blood flow\, strengthen immunity & clear the mind. 
 Implement various techniques to purify\, energize\, focus & calm the mind 
 & nervous system & harness the vital life force energy - with kumbhaka & b
 andha (breath holds and internal locks). Known to increase neuroplasticity
 \, nitric oxide\, and erase old mental and emotional patterns. Traditional
 ly\, pranayama is the doorway to access higher states of consciousness.\n\
 nThroughout the ongoing class different practices will be presented. Learn
  Cleansing kriyas\, Himalayan Pranayama including including Ujjayi Variati
 ons\, Heating & Cooling Breaths\, Solar\, Lunar & Soli-Lunar Nadi Shuddhi 
 practices\, Samantraka Pranayama\, Mudra\, Pratyahara\, Subtle & Contempla
 tive Practices. Includes Pranava techniques for contemplation and merging 
 with the vibration and sound of Om and Nada - internal sound current.\n\nK
 ara is a long time practitioner & teacher- trained extensively with Himala
 yan yoga adepts in advanced pranayama & mudra using the breath as the guid
 e for transformation and self-empowerment. With deep knowledge of pranayam
 a\, she safely guides practitioners progressively.\n\nPlease practice on a
 n empty stomach. Please bring a mat or blanket and a cushion or folded bla
 nket to sit on. Please wear layers.\nRagle Ranch Park\, Sebastopol\nRSVP -
  $20 - Discounted Class Series'\, Sliding Scale Available\nContact Kara 70
 7-235-1413\nsunyogadance@gmail.com
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/nataraja-school-of-traditional-yoga/e
 vents/315199232/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260610T160709Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610T160709Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
